# The test gate, run before the assigned work.

## 1. cargo test --workspace, at mock/
error: manifest path .../mock contains no package: The manifest is virtual,
and the workspace has no members.
Expected: mock/Cargo.toml declares members = [] on purpose, because mock/crates
was deleted while the canon is written. There is no source tier to test.

## 2. cargo mock test  --  DID NOT TERMINATE
It reaches mock/benches/variants/ and runs each bench crate's tests in DEBUG.
bench_bitpack_write_contend_shared ran 25 minutes wall at ~200% CPU without
finishing and was stopped. A second copy of the same binary, from a different
clone of this repo, was already at 132 minutes of CPU when this session began
and is still running, so this is not particular to this worktree.
Cause, read rather than guessed: src/stress.rs runs 3000 four-thread
concurrency trials at STRESS_N, plus 1000 and 500 more in two neighbours,
unoptimised.

